@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8081
@run = manual-001

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 正常完成；预期 COMPLETED、saved=true、费用 12
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{run}}-normal",
  "topic": "字幕活动",
  "budgetUnits": 20,
  "deadlineTime": "2030-01-01T12:00:00Z",
  "preferredMode": "STANDARD"
}

### 查询任务
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/plans/{{run}}-normal

### 查看动作与工具结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/plans/{{run}}-normal/trace

### 预算调整；默认费用表下标准方案 12，精简方案 8
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{run}}-budget",
  "topic": "字幕活动",
  "budgetUnits": 10,
  "deadlineTime": "2030-01-01T12:00:00Z",
  "preferredMode": "STANDARD"
}

### 缺预算；预期 NEEDS_INPUT，模型步骤和费用为 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{run}}-missing-budget",
  "topic": "字幕活动",
  "deadlineTime": "2030-01-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### 缺截止时间；预期 NEEDS_INPUT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{run}}-missing-deadline",
  "topic": "字幕活动",
  "budgetUnits": 10
}

### 脚本工具失败一次；检查失败记录及模型后续动作
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{run}}-tool-failure",
  "topic": "字幕活动",
  "budgetUnits": 10,
  "deadlineTime": "2030-01-01T12:00:00Z",
  "preferredMode": "STANDARD",
  "simulate": {
    "failTool": "GENERATE_SCRIPT",
    "failures": 1
  }
}

### 工具失败后的决策记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/plans/{{run}}-tool-failure/trace

### 无可行预算；预期 INCOMPLETE、saved=false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{run}}-impossible",
  "topic": "字幕活动",
  "budgetUnits": 2,
  "deadlineTime": "2030-01-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### 保存事务故障；核对回滚记录及实际保存状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "{{run}}-save-failure",
  "topic": "字幕活动",
  "budgetUnits": 20,
  "deadlineTime": "2030-01-01T12:00:00Z",
  "simulate": {
    "failTool": "SAVE_PLAN",
    "failures": 2,
    "failAfterInsert": true
  }
}

### 保存失败后的决策记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/plans/{{run}}-save-failure/trace

### 显式续跑；核对成功步骤未重复收费
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/plans/{{run}}-save-failure/resume
